{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj55G9QTDJbRXkMcW6WE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, unremarkable door. But set into its center, where a knob should be, is a single keyhole — ancient, iron-rimmed, dark as a pupil staring back at you.*\n\n*The door does not move. It does not speak. It waits.*\n\n*The keyhole breathes — a faint, cold draft from the other side. Something shifts in the darkness beyond.*\n\n*You feel the weight of every key you've ever held. Every choice that locked something away. Every answer you turned and heard click.*\n\n    ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n    ░░╔══════════════╗░░░░\n    ░░║              ║░░░░\n    ░░║              ║░░░░\n    ░░║              ║░░░░\n    ░░║         ◈    ║░░░░\n    ░░║              ║░░░░\n    ░░║              ║░░░░\n    ░░║              ║░░░░\n    ░░╚══════════════╝░░░░\n    ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n\n*The draft whispers:*\n\n**What do you bring to open me?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":320,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}